%% Complete Analysis Pipeline Data Flow
%% From source files to visualization

sequenceDiagram
    participant User
    participant CLI as CLI (BuildCommand)
    participant Scanner as FileScanner
    participant Extractor as ASTSymbolExtractor
    participant DB as DatabaseManager
    participant JSONL as SymbolRegistryManager
    participant Graph as SymbolGraphBuilder
    participant Analyzers as Analysis Suite
    participant Viz as MermaidGenerator

    %% Build Phase
    User->>CLI: tsdoc-edge build src
    CLI->>Scanner: Scan directories
    Scanner-->>CLI: 131 TypeScript files

    Note over CLI,Extractor: Extraction Phase (2.2s)

    loop For each file
        CLI->>Extractor: extract(file)
        Extractor->>Extractor: Parse TypeScript AST
        Extractor->>Extractor: Visit nodes (functions, classes, etc.)
        Extractor->>Extractor: Extract type information
        Extractor->>Extractor: Detect constants
        Extractor->>Extractor: Track exports
        Extractor-->>CLI: ExtractedSymbol[]
    end

    Note over CLI,DB: Storage Phase

    CLI->>DB: insertSymbol(symbol) × 1,438
    DB->>DB: Validate schema
    DB->>DB: JSON.stringify(metadata)
    DB->>DB: INSERT INTO symbols

    CLI->>DB: insertRelationship(rel) × 1,902
    DB->>DB: INSERT INTO dependencies

    CLI->>JSONL: exportToJsonl()
    JSONL->>DB: SELECT * FROM symbols
    DB-->>JSONL: All symbols
    JSONL->>JSONL: Write JSONL lines
    JSONL-->>CLI: managed/symbols.jsonl

    Note over CLI,User: Build Complete: 1,438 symbols, 1,902 rels

    %% Analysis Phase
    User->>CLI: tsdoc-edge analyze-chains
    CLI->>DB: Load symbols & relationships
    DB-->>CLI: Rows

    CLI->>Graph: Build graph
    Graph->>Graph: Create adjacency list
    Graph-->>CLI: SymbolGraph

    CLI->>Analyzers: DependencyChainAnalyzer
    Analyzers->>Analyzers: DFS traversal
    Analyzers->>Analyzers: Detect circulars
    Analyzers->>Analyzers: Calculate hotspots
    Analyzers-->>CLI: 0 circulars, 10 hotspots

    CLI->>DB: Save circular relationships
    Note over CLI,User: Analysis Complete: <200ms

    %% I/O Analysis Phase
    User->>CLI: tsdoc-edge analyze-io
    CLI->>Graph: Build graph with types

    CLI->>Analyzers: IODependencyAnalyzer
    Analyzers->>Analyzers: Build producer map (type→symbols)
    Analyzers->>Analyzers: Build consumer map (type→symbols)
    Analyzers->>Analyzers: Match types (intersection)
    Analyzers->>Analyzers: Calculate confidence
    Analyzers-->>CLI: 7,446 I/O dependencies

    CLI->>Analyzers: Detect pipelines
    Analyzers->>Analyzers: Build I/O adjacency list
    Analyzers->>Analyzers: Find A→B→C chains
    Analyzers-->>CLI: 25,809 pipelines

    CLI->>DB: Save I/O dependencies
    Note over CLI,User: I/O Analysis Complete

    %% Visualization Phase
    User->>CLI: tsdoc-edge visualize hotspots
    CLI->>Graph: Load graph
    CLI->>Analyzers: Get hotspot data
    Analyzers-->>CLI: Top 10 hotspots

    CLI->>Viz: generateHotspotDiagram(hotspots)
    Viz->>Viz: Build Mermaid DSL
    Viz->>Viz: Add color styling
    Viz-->>CLI: Mermaid code

    CLI->>CLI: Write to file
    CLI-->>User: .tsdoc/diagrams/hotspots.mmd

    Note over User,Viz: User opens in VS Code<br/>Diagram renders automatically

    %% Performance annotations
    Note over Scanner,Extractor: 2.2s for 131 files
    Note over Analyzers,CLI: <200ms for all analysis
    Note over DB: 2.4 MB SQLite + 1.8 MB JSONL
